{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24827","headline":"丁巳岁八月祭武侯祠堂因题临淮公旧碑 · 杨嗣复","name":"丁巳岁八月祭武侯祠堂因题临淮公旧碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斋庄修祀事，旌斾出郊闉。\n薙草轩墀狭，涂墙赭垩新。\n谋猷期作圣，风俗奉爲神。\n酹酒成坳泽，持兵列偶人。\n非才膺宠任，异代揖芳尘。\n况是平津客，碑前泪满巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨嗣复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}